{"seq":1,"slug":"terratest-pulumi-testing","title":"Terratest 与 Pulumi 测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/tools-frameworks/terratest-pulumi-testing","wordCount":1152,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"terratest-与-pulumi-测试\">Terratest 与 Pulumi 测试</h1><p>基础设施测试框架的选择本质上是一个&quot;通用编程语言测试&quot;vs&quot;声明式原生测试&quot;的取舍。Terratest 选择了前者——用 Go 语言的全部表达力编写测试；Pulumi 的测试则天然继承了宿主语言（TypeScript/Python/Go）的测试生态；而 OpenTofu/Terraform 原生 <code>.tftest.hcl</code> 提供零额外依赖的声明式方案。三者各有最佳适用场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Terratest</strong>：Go 语言库，通过真实部署-验证-销毁循环测试基础设施</li>\n<li><strong>OpenTofu 原生测试</strong>：<code>.tftest.hcl</code> 文件，零外部依赖的声明式测试框架</li>\n<li><strong>Mock Provider</strong>：OpenTofu 1.8+ 的 mock 能力，实现零成本单元测试</li>\n<li><strong>Pulumi 测试体系</strong>：利用宿主语言测试框架（Jest/pytest/go test）进行多层验证</li>\n<li><strong>分层选型</strong>：按金字塔层级组合不同工具，避免用重型框架解决轻量问题</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"terratest-go-驱动的基础设施验证\">Terratest：Go 驱动的基础设施验证</h2><p>Terratest（Gruntwork 维护，v1.0.1 稳定版）是一个 Go 库，其设计哲学是：<strong>测试基础设施代码应该和测试应用代码一样严格</strong>。它不发明新的 DSL，而是利用 Go 的 <code>testing</code> 包、标准断言库和丰富的 SDK 生态来验证真实基础设施。</p>\n<p>核心工作流四步循环：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[编写 Go 测试] --&gt; B[Deploy: terraform apply]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Validate: HTTP/SSH/API]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Undeploy: terraform destroy]&#10;    D --&gt; A\">graph LR\n    A[编写 Go 测试] --&gt; B[Deploy: terraform apply]\n    B --&gt; C[Validate: HTTP/SSH/API]\n    C --&gt; D[Undeploy: terraform destroy]\n    D --&gt; A</pre><h3 id=\"核心模块架构\">核心模块架构</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模块路径</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>典型用法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>modules/terraform</code></td>\n<td>Terraform 生命周期管理</td>\n<td>Init、Plan、Apply、Destroy、Output</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>modules/k8s</code></td>\n<td>Kubernetes 资源验证</td>\n<td>Pod 就绪检查、Service 端点测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>modules/aws</code></td>\n<td>AWS 资源查询</td>\n<td>获取 VPC 属性、验证安全组规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>modules/http-helper</code></td>\n<td>HTTP 端点验证</td>\n<td>重试请求直到 200</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>modules/ssh</code></td>\n<td>SSH 远程执行</td>\n<td>验证服务运行状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>modules/random</code></td>\n<td>随机值生成</td>\n<td>测试隔离的唯一 ID</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"实战示例-验证-vpc-模块\">实战示例：验证 VPC 模块</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"package test&#10;&#10;import (&#10;    &quot;testing&quot;&#10;    &quot;github.com/gruntwork-io/terratest/modules/terraform&quot;&#10;    &quot;github.com/gruntwork-io/terratest/modules/aws&quot;&#10;    &quot;github.com/stretchr/testify/assert&quot;&#10;)&#10;&#10;func TestVPCModule(t *testing.T) {&#10;    t.Parallel()&#10;&#10;    terraformOptions := &amp;terraform.Options{&#10;        TerraformDir: &quot;../modules/vpc&quot;,&#10;        Vars: map[string]interface{}{&#10;            &quot;vpc_cidr&quot;:    &quot;10.0.0.0/16&quot;,&#10;            &quot;environment&quot;: &quot;test&quot;,&#10;            &quot;az_count&quot;:    2,&#10;        },&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    defer terraform.Destroy(t, terraformOptions)&#10;    terraform.InitAndApply(t, terraformOptions)&#10;&#10;    vpcID := terraform.Output(t, terraformOptions, &quot;vpc_id&quot;)&#10;    subnets := aws.GetSubnetsForVpc(t, vpcID, &quot;us-east-1&quot;)&#10;&#10;    assert.Equal(t, 4, len(subnets)) // 2 public + 2 private&#10;&#10;    vpc := aws.GetVpcById(t, vpcID, &quot;us-east-1&quot;)&#10;    assert.Equal(t, &quot;10.0.0.0/16&quot;, vpc.CidrBlock)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">package</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">testing</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">github.com/gruntwork-io/terratest/modules/terraform</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">github.com/gruntwork-io/terratest/modules/aws</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">github.com/stretchr/testify/assert</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TestVPCModule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">testing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    t.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Parallel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    terraformOptions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">terraform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        TerraformDir: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../modules/vpc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Vars: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"vpc_cidr\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:    </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"10.0.0.0/16\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"environment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"az_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:    </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> terraform.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Destroy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, terraformOptions)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    terraform.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">InitAndApply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, terraformOptions)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    vpcID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> terraform.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Output</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, terraformOptions, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"vpc_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    subnets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aws.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetSubnetsForVpc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, vpcID, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"us-east-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    assert.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Equal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(subnets)) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2 public + 2 private</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    vpc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aws.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetVpcById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, vpcID, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"us-east-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    assert.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Equal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"10.0.0.0/16\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, vpc.CidrBlock)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"terratest-的测试加速技巧\">Terratest 的测试加速技巧</h3><p>Terratest 测试最大的痛点是执行时间。几个关键优化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>t.Parallel()</code></strong>：并行执行独立测试用例</li>\n<li><strong><code>test_structure.SaveTerraformOptions</code></strong>：在长测试中保存中间状态，崩溃后可恢复</li>\n<li><strong>Stage 分离</strong>：将 deploy/validate/undeploy 分成独立阶段，开发时跳过 undeploy</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"opentofu-terraform-原生测试框架\">OpenTofu/Terraform 原生测试框架</h2><p>自 Terraform v1.6（OpenTofu 同步支持）引入的 <code>.tftest.hcl</code> 框架消除了对外部语言的依赖。2026 年 OpenTofu 1.8+ 进一步增加了 <code>mock_provider</code> 支持，使纯单元测试成为可能。</p>\n<h3 id=\"原生测试-vs-terratest-决策矩阵\">原生测试 vs Terratest 决策矩阵</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th><code>.tftest.hcl</code> 原生</th>\n<th>Terratest (Go)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>学习成本</td>\n<td>低（HCL 熟悉者）</td>\n<td>高（需要 Go 基础）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表达力</td>\n<td>有限（断言为主）</td>\n<td>完整编程语言</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mock 支持</td>\n<td>原生 mock_provider</td>\n<td>需要 LocalStack 等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP/SSH 验证</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>内置模块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多云验证</td>\n<td>受限于 provider</td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI 集成</td>\n<td><code>tofu test</code> 一条命令</td>\n<td><code>go test</code> + 依赖管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社区生态</td>\n<td>增长中</td>\n<td>成熟（6 年+）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>选型建议</strong>：模块级输入/输出验证用原生测试；需要 HTTP 端点检查、SSH 执行、复杂条件逻辑或跨多个 Terraform root module 的编排用 Terratest。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pulumi-的多层测试体系\">Pulumi 的多层测试体系</h2><p>Pulumi 的测试方案因其&quot;基础设施即<em>真正的</em>代码&quot;的特性而独特——测试直接使用宿主语言的测试框架：</p>\n<h3 id=\"单元测试-mock-替换\">单元测试：Mock 替换</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import * as pulumi from &#39;@pulumi/pulumi&#39;;&#10;import * as aws from &#39;@pulumi/aws&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 设置 mock 环境&#10;pulumi.runtime.setMocks({&#10;  newResource: (args) =&gt; {&#10;    return { id: `${args.name}-id`, state: args.inputs };&#10;  },&#10;  call: (args) =&gt; {&#10;    return args.inputs;&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&#10;describe(&#39;VPC Module&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  let vpc: aws.ec2.Vpc;&#10;&#10;  beforeAll(async () =&gt; {&#10;    vpc = new aws.ec2.Vpc(&#39;test-vpc&#39;, {&#10;      cidrBlock: &#39;10.0.0.0/16&#39;,&#10;      enableDnsHostnames: true,&#10;    });&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  it(&#39;should have DNS hostnames enabled&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;    const dnsEnabled = await vpc.enableDnsHostnames;&#10;    expect(dnsEnabled).toBe(true);&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pulumi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@pulumi/pulumi'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aws </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@pulumi/aws'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 设置 mock 环境</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pulumi.runtime.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setMocks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  newResource</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">args</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { id: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}-id`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, state: args.inputs };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  call</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">args</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> args.inputs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'VPC Module'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vpc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aws</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ec2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Vpc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  beforeAll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    vpc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aws.ec2.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Vpc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'test-vpc'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      cidrBlock: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'10.0.0.0/16'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      enableDnsHostnames: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'should have DNS hostnames enabled'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dnsEnabled</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vpc.enableDnsHostnames;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dnsEnabled).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"集成测试-automation-api\">集成测试：Automation API</h3><p>Pulumi Automation API 允许在测试代码中直接驱动 stack 的创建和销毁：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{pulumi} = T_{preview} + T_{up} + T_{validate} + T_{destroy}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mi</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">oy</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"policy-测试-crossguard\">Policy 测试：CrossGuard</h3><p>Pulumi CrossGuard 允许编写策略规则来验证所有资源必须满足的约束（加密、标签、网络隔离）。策略与测试的区别在于：测试验证<em>期望行为</em>，策略<em>阻止违规行为</em>。关于策略测试的深入讨论，参见 <a href=\"policy-testing-opa-sentinel\">策略测试（OPA/Sentinel）</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测试框架的组合使用\">测试框架的组合使用</h2><p>成熟团队通常不只使用一种框架，而是在金字塔的不同层级组合：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>推荐工具</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静态分析</td>\n<td>tflint + Checkov</td>\n<td>零成本、即时反馈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单元（plan）</td>\n<td><code>.tftest.hcl</code> + mock</td>\n<td>无需 Go、无需云凭证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成（apply）</td>\n<td>Terratest</td>\n<td>丰富的验证能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>策略门禁</td>\n<td>CrossGuard / Conftest</td>\n<td>组织级合规强制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这种分层组合使每种工具在其最擅长的层级发挥作用，避免了用重型框架解决轻量问题。关于如何将这些工具编排进 CI/CD 管道，参见 <a href=\"../operations/infra-test-in-pipeline\">CI/CD 中的基础设施测试</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>基础设施测试框架的选择不是非此即彼——Terratest 提供 Go 语言的全部表达力适合复杂集成验证，OpenTofu 原生测试以零依赖和 mock provider 覆盖模块级单元测试，Pulumi 测试体系则天然融入宿主语言生态。成熟团队在金字塔的不同层级组合使用这些工具：底层用声明式原生测试快速验证，顶层用通用语言框架进行深度集成验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Terratest 与 Pulumi 测试","id":"terratest-与-pulumi-测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Terratest：Go 驱动的基础设施验证","id":"terratest-go-驱动的基础设施验证"},{"level":3,"text":"核心模块架构","id":"核心模块架构"},{"level":3,"text":"实战示例：验证 VPC 模块","id":"实战示例-验证-vpc-模块"},{"level":3,"text":"Terratest 的测试加速技巧","id":"terratest-的测试加速技巧"},{"level":2,"text":"OpenTofu/Terraform 原生测试框架","id":"opentofu-terraform-原生测试框架"},{"level":3,"text":"原生测试 vs Terratest 决策矩阵","id":"原生测试-vs-terratest-决策矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"Pulumi 的多层测试体系","id":"pulumi-的多层测试体系"},{"level":3,"text":"单元测试：Mock 替换","id":"单元测试-mock-替换"},{"level":3,"text":"集成测试：Automation API","id":"集成测试-automation-api"},{"level":3,"text":"Policy 测试：CrossGuard","id":"policy-测试-crossguard"},{"level":2,"text":"测试框架的组合使用","id":"测试框架的组合使用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"测试环境与策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/foundations/testing-environments-strategies"},"next":{"title":"策略测试（OPA/Sentinel）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/tools-frameworks/policy-testing-opa-sentinel"}}